    "causal_summary": "The migration needs a deterministic git-mv engine driven by an explicit semantic source-to-target map. It must batch by dependency closure, skip every policy exemption, abort safely on collisions, remain idempotent, and support dry-run and rollback without performing the migration during authoring.",
